flowchart TD
    W([Write traffic per key and partition is monitored]) --> D{Hot key or hot partition detected?}
    D -->|No| N[Keep the current routing]
    D -->|Yes| C{Mitigation choice}
    C -->|Salt the key| S["Append a random salt so the hot key's writes spread across partitions; reads query all salted partitions and merge"]
    C -->|Split or reshard| R[Dynamic resharding: split the hot shard and move part of its key range to another node]
    S --> OK[Per-partition write load back under the threshold]
    R --> OK
